message: "If you use these course materials, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "AI Agent Literacy: An Open Course on Working with AI Coding Agents"
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Jun-Hao
    alias: 陳俊豪
  - family-names: Liu
